LRC(14) 1-D WEYL DECORRELATION LEMMA — exact decay of Delta_w (kps-S12b)

Delta_w(E) = p0(E) - Plat(E'),  Plat(E') = p0(E') + (1/7) p1(E'),  E'=core, w=far element.
Claim (HYP-2642): |Delta_w| <= C/w.  We extract C and check the cap margin.

